cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ISPCC-Applications: Cascade State Predictor and Domain Applications"
message: "If you use these applications, please cite both this repository and the ISPCC-3SIMM-PRISM framework below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Vaduva
    given-names: Radu-Andrei
date-released: 2026-08-03
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Radu2914/ISPCC-Applications"
abstract: >
  Application implementations of the ISPCC framework including the
  Cascade State Predictor (CSP) for industrial bearing condition
  monitoring, harmonic interval analysis, and electromagnetic
  surrogate modeling. Each application derives variable classification
  and normalising constants from domain physics independently before
  encoding.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "ISPCC-3SIMM-PRISM: Intentional Symbolic Pre-Cognitive Computing Framework"
    authors:
